TI  - Efficacy of contrast versus non-contrast CT surveillance among patients surviving two years without recurrence after surgery for stage I lung cancer
PY  - 2025
T2  - Scientific Reports
VL  - 15
IS  - 1
C7  - 6142
DO  - 10.1038/s41598-025-90124-x
