TI  - Is Robotic-Assisted Surgery Associated With Receipt of Guideline-Directed Lymph Node Sampling in Wedge Resection for Early-Stage NSCLC?
PY  - 2025
T2  - Annals of Thoracic Surgery Short Reports
VL  - 3
IS  - 4
