TI  - Anatomic Lung Resection Is Associated With Improved Survival Compared With Wedge Resection for Stage IA (≤2 cm) NSCLC
PY  - 2025
T2  - Journal of Thoracic Oncology
VL  - 20
IS  - 8
SP  - 1075
EP  - 1085
DO  - 10.1016/j.jtho.2025.03.042
