TI  - Social Vulnerability Index Is Associated With Major Morbidity After Lung Resection
PY  - 2025
T2  - Annals of Thoracic Surgery Short Reports
VL  - 3
IS  - 1
SP  - 144
EP  - 149
DO  - 10.1016/j.atssr.2024.09.012
