TI  - Optimizing lung cancer surgery in the elderly: sublobar resection versus lobectomy for early-stage non-small cell lung cancer patients aged 80 and above
PY  - 2024
T2  - Discover Oncology
VL  - 15
IS  - 1
C7  - 585
