TI  - Short-term outcomes of robotic- vs. television-assisted thoracoscopic segmental lung resection for early-stage non-small-cell lung cancer in the day surgery models
PY  - 2024
T2  - Journal of Thoracic Disease
VL  - 16
IS  - 11
SP  - 7257
