TI  - Potential Impact of Omega 6/3 Ratio and CD68+ Macrophage Infiltration on Survival in NSCLC Patients Undergoing Pulmonary Resection
PY  - 2024
T2  - Current Oncology
VL  - 31
IS  - 9
SP  - 5098
EP  - 5106
