TI  - Self-reported dyspnoea and shortness of breathing deterioration in long-term survivors after segmentectomy or lobectomy for early-stage lung cancer
PY  - 2024
T2  - European Journal of Cardio-thoracic Surgery
VL  - 65
IS  - 5
C7  - ezae200
