TI  - Vascular invasion predicts the subgroup of lung adenocarcinomas ≤2.0 cm at risk of poor outcome treated by wedge resection compared to lobectomy
PY  - 2023
T2  - JTCVS Open
VL  - 16
SP  - 938
EP  - 947
