TI  - The comparison of Lobe-Specific or Systematic Mediastinal Lymph Node Dissection for Early-Stage Lung Adenocarcinoma With Consolidation Tumor Ratio Over 0.5
PY  - 2023
T2  - Clinical Lung Cancer
VL  - 24
