TI  - Patient-Reported Outcomes of Video-Assisted Thoracoscopic Surgery Versus Thoracotomy for Locally Advanced Lung Cancer: A Longitudinal Cohort Study
PY  - 2021
T2  - Annals of Surgical Oncology
VL  - 28
IS  - 13
SP  - 8358
