TI  - Lobe-specific lymph node dissection in stage IA non-small-cell lung cancer: A retrospective cohort study
PY  - 2021
T2  - European Journal of Cardio-thoracic Surgery
VL  - 59
IS  - 4
SP  - 783
EP  - 790
DO  - 10.1093/ejcts/ezaa369
