TI  - Stereotactic body radiation therapy (SBRT) for patients with stage i non-small cell lung cancer is applicable to more tumors than sublobar resection
PY  - 2021
T2  - Journal of Thoracic Disease
VL  - 13
IS  - 3
SP  - 1576
