TI  - Comparing Segmentectomy and Lobectomy for Clinical Stage IA Solid-dominant Lung Cancer Measuring 2.1 to 3 cm
PY  - 2020
T2  - Clinical Lung Cancer
VL  - 21
IS  - 6
SP  - e528
EP  - e538
