TI  - Recurrence After Stereotactic Body Radiation Therapy Versus Lobectomy for Non-Small Cell Lung Cancer
PY  - 2020
T2  - Annals of Thoracic Surgery
VL  - 110
IS  - 3
SP  - 998
EP  - 1005
