TI  - Comparison of the outcomes of stereotactic body radiotherapy versus surgical treatment for elderly (≥70) patients with early-stage non-small cell lung cancer after propensity score matching
PY  - 2019
T2  - Radiation Oncology
VL  - 14
IS  - 1
C7  - 195
