TI  - Verification of meta-analysis and propensity-matched analysis comparing stereotactic body radiation therapy versus surgery for early stage lung cancer
PY  - 2019
T2  - Journal of Thoracic Disease
VL  - 11
IS  - 6
SP  - 2201
