TI  - Low-dose indocyanine green fluorescence-navigated segmentectomy: Prospective analysis of 20 cases and review of previous reports
PY  - 2019
T2  - Journal of Thoracic Disease
VL  - 11
IS  - 3
SP  - 702
EP  - 707
