TI  - The Persistent Problem of Local/Regional Failure After Surgical Intervention for Early-Stage Lung Cancer
PY  - 2018
T2  - Annals of Thoracic Surgery
VL  - 106
IS  - 2
SP  - 382
EP  - 389
DO  - 10.1016/j.athoracsur.2018.03.062
UR  - https://www.scopus.com/inward/record.uri?eid=2-s2.0-85049353699&doi=10.1016%2Fj.athoracsur.2018.03.062&partnerID=40&md5=12582aa5a1de494279bdd8231c914155
AD  - UNC School of Medicine, Department of Radiation Oncology, Chapel Hill, NC, United States
AD  - UNC Health, Chapel Hill, NC, United States
