TI  - Stereotactic body radiation therapy (SBRT) in the management of non-small-cell lung cancer: Clinical impact and patient perspectives
PY  - 2018
T2  - Lung Cancer: Targets and Therapy
VL  - 9
SP  - 13
EP  - 23
