TI  - Anatomical segmentectomy and wedge resections are associated with comparable outcomes for patients with small cT1N0 non-small cell lung cancer
PY  - 2016
T2  - Journal of Thoracic Oncology
VL  - 11
IS  - 11
SP  - 1984
EP  - 1992
DO  - 10.1016/j.jtho.2016.06.031
