TI  - Comparison of treatment outcomes between single-port videoassisted thoracoscopic anatomic segmentectomy and lobectomy for non-small cell lung cancer of early-stage: A retrospective observational study
PY  - 2016
T2  - Journal of Thoracic Disease
VL  - 8
IS  - 6
