TI  - Comparison of thoracoscopic segmentectomy and thoracoscopic lobectomy on the patients with non-small cell lung cancer: A propensity score matching study
PY  - 2015
T2  - European Journal of Cardio-thoracic Surgery
VL  - 48
IS  - 2
SP  - 273
EP  - 278
DO  - 10.1093/ejcts/ezu422
UR  - https://www.scopus.com/inward/record.uri?eid=2-s2.0-84938592380&doi=10.1093%2Fejcts%2Fezu422&partnerID=40&md5=16b908fd51fd225a4af074ea810fd640
