DO  - 10.1007/s11748-014-0493-8
UR  - https://www.scopus.com/inward/record.uri?eid=2-s2.0-84939936488&doi=10.1007%2Fs11748-014-0493-8&partnerID=40&md5=a50e5f9f875fb63350b567caf9b39183
