TI  - What is the extent of the advantage of video-assisted thoracoscopic surgical resection over thoracotomy in terms of delivery of adjuvant chemotherapy following non-small-cell lung cancer resection?
PY  - 2014
T2  - Interactive Cardiovascular and Thoracic Surgery
VL  - 19
