TI  - Association of increased postoperative opioid administration with non-small-cell lung cancer recurrence: A retrospective analysis
PY  - 2014
T2  - British Journal of Anaesthesia
VL  - 113
IS  - SUPPL. 1
SP  - i88
EP  - i94
