TI  - Predicted postoperative lung function is associated with all-cause long-term mortality after major lung resection for cancer
PY  - 2014
T2  - European Journal of Cardio-thoracic Surgery
VL  - 45
IS  - 4
C7  - ezt462
SP  - 660
EP  - 664
