TI  - Safety and efficacy of thoracoscopic wedge resection for elderly high-risk patients with stage I peripheral non-small-cell lung cancer
PY  - 2013
T2  - Journal of Cardiothoracic Surgery
VL  - 8
IS  - 1
C7  - 231
DO  - 10.1186/1749-8090-8-231
