TI  - Segmentectomy as a safe and equally effective surgical option under complete video-assisted thoracic surgery for patients of stage I non-small cell lung cancer
PY  - 2013
T2  - Journal of Cardiothoracic Surgery
VL  - 8
IS  - 1
C7  - 116
DO  - 10.1186/1749-8090-8-116
