TI  - Consistently lower narcotics consumption after video-assisted thoracoscopic surgery for early stage non-small cell lung cancer when compared to open surgery: A one-year follow-up study
PY  - 2013
T2  - European Journal of Cardio-thoracic Surgery
VL  - 43
IS  - 4
