TI  - Diagnostic work-up and surgery in participants of the gdansk lung cancer screening programme: The incidence of surgery for non-malignant conditions
PY  - 2013
T2  - Interactive Cardiovascular and Thoracic Surgery
VL  - 17
IS  - 6
