TI  - Is limited pulmonary resection equivalent to lobectomy for surgical management of stage i non-small-cell lung cancer?
PY  - 2012
T2  - Interactive Cardiovascular and Thoracic Surgery
VL  - 14
IS  - 6
SP  - 816
EP  - 820
