TI  - Thirty- and ninety-day outcomes after sublobar resection with and without brachytherapy for non-small cell lung cancer: Results from a multicenter phase III study
PY  - 2011
T2  - Journal of Thoracic and Cardiovascular Surgery
VL  - 142
IS  - 5
SP  - 1143
EP  - 1151
