TI  - Anatomic thoracoscopic lung resection for non-small cell lung cancer in stage i is associated with less morbidity and shorter hospitalization than thoracotomy
PY  - 2011
T2  - Acta Oncologica
VL  - 50
IS  - 7
SP  - 1126
