TI  - Bilobectomy for non-small cell lung cancer: A search for clinical factors that may affect perioperative morbidity and long-term survival
PY  - 2010
T2  - Journal of Thoracic and Cardiovascular Surgery
VL  - 139
IS  - 3
SP  - 606
EP  - 611
