TI  - Systematic review and meta-analysis of randomized and nonrandomized trials on safety and efficacy of video-assisted thoracic surgery lobectomy for early-stage non-small-cell lung cancer
PY  - 2009
T2  - Journal of Clinical Oncology
VL  - 27
IS  - 15
SP  - 2553
