TI  - Use of Video-Assisted Thoracic Surgery for Lobectomy in the Elderly Results in Fewer Complications
PY  - 2008
T2  - Annals of Thoracic Surgery
VL  - 85
IS  - 1
SP  - 231
EP  - 236
