TI  - Adjuvant therapeutic vaccination in patients with non-small cell lung cancer made lymphopenic and reconstituted with autologous PBMC: First clinical experience and evidence of an immune response
PY  - 2007
T2  - Journal of Translational Medicine
VL  - 5
C7  - 43
DO  - 10.1186/1479-5876-5-43
UR  - https://www.scopus.com/inward/record.uri?eid=2-s2.0-35348883568&doi=10.1186%2F1479-5876-5-43&partnerID=40&md5=464aaaac90a3f4689af50b6c7c4b24c1
