TI  - Comparison in prognosis after VATS lobectomy and open lobectomy for stage I lung cancer: Retrospective analysis focused on a histological subgroup
PY  - 2007
T2  - Surgical Endoscopy
VL  - 21
IS  - 9
SP  - 1607
EP  - 1611
DO  - 10.1007/s00464-007-9200-5
UR  - https://www.scopus.com/inward/record.uri?eid=2-s2.0-34548390611&doi=10.1007%2Fs00464-007-9200-5&partnerID=40&md5=97463ee444a27c784561bd1a33d995e0
AD  - National Hospital Organization, Japan, Department of Thoracic Surgery, Tokyo, Tokyo, Japan
