TI  - VATS is an adequate oncological operation for stage I non-small cell lung cancer
PY  - 2002
T2  - European Journal of Cardio-thoracic Surgery
VL  - 21
IS  - 6
SP  - 1094
EP  - 1099
DO  - 10.1016/S1010-7940(02)00179-3
