TI  - Significance of lymphangiosis carcinomatosa at the bronchial resection margin in patients with non-small cell lung cancer
PY  - 2001
T2  - Annals of Thoracic Surgery
VL  - 72
IS  - 4
SP  - 1160
EP  - 1164
