TI  - Is follow-up of lung cancer patients after resection medically indicated and cost-effective?
PY  - 1995
T2  - Annals of Thoracic Surgery
VL  - 60
IS  - 6
SP  - 1563
EP  - 1572
DO  - 10.1016/0003-4975(95)00893-4
